m/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100446","id":2743056432,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jf7gw","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-21T11:14:36Z","updated_at":"2025-03-21T11:14:36Z","body":"Yeah if there's no downside to moving to HashMap, I'm fine with removing VMap. CC @godotengine/core \r\n\r\nThis technically breaks compatibility for thirdparty C++ modules which may rely on it, but if they do they can simply copy the `vmap.h` file in their own module.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2743056432/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2743070559","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100446#issuecomment-2743070559","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100446","id":2743070559,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jf-9f","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-21T11:21:12Z","updated_at":"2025-03-21T11:21:12Z","body":"It's a good candidate for removal. I'll bring it up at the next core meeting.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2743070559/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2755222524","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100446#issuecomment-2755222524","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100446","id":2755222524,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kOVv8","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-26T17:36:58Z","updated_at":"2025-03-26T17:37:43Z","body":"We discussed this proposal in the core meeting. We agreed that generally, this is a good idea, and if we proceed with it there's it's fine to remove `VMap` to lighten the codebase (cc @reduz, the author, in case you want to keep it).\r\n\r\nHowever, given that this deals with shaders, we need to be _very_ sure that this PR that this PR doesn't cause performance regressions, so benchmarking it is absolutely needed for it to be merged.\r\n\r\nPersonally, I'd try to familiarize myself with visual shaders enough to get a feeling for how to benchmark it, then benchmark it in place with a very demanding task. Perhaps someone from @godotengine/shaders has any tips? :)\r\n\r\nIt may also be enough to show that the code isn't called often and is thus risk-free, but one use is in `_update_shader` so I'm not sure if that's the case.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2755222524/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2759108344","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100446#issuecomment-2759108344","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100446","id":2759108344,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kdKb4","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-27T18:52:50Z","updated_at":"2025-03-27T18:52:50Z","body":"I took some time to familiarize myself with VisualShader and ran a simple stress test. My conclusion is that `VMap` is not a performance bottleneck.  \r\n\r\nI commented out [these lines](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/594d64ec244b6b99321e2096987d4d69de4c8845/scene/resources/visual_shader.cpp#L2533C2-L2535C3), forcing `VisualShader::_update_shader()` to always update the shader. (Note: Modifying this will cause a crash when opening the VisualShader editor, so don't try to view the shader.) Then, I called `_update_shader()` every frame to create a heavy load. \r\n\r\nProfiling results show that most of the time is spent on shader compilation rather than the VisualShader-to-Shader conversion. Even within the conversion process, `VMap` accounts for only a small portion of the overhead (0.5% or so). Most of the time is spent on string operations.\r\n\r\nTest project: [test_visual_shader.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19492360/test_visual_shader.zip)\r\n\r\nI have difficulty finding or creating complex visual shaders (the code seems clever enough to skip disconnected nodes so I can't just add bunches of nodes). If someone can provide a complex shader I'm happy to test it.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2759108344/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2867181463","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100446#issuecomment-2867181463","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100446","id":2867181463,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6q5beX","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-09T16:34:59Z","updated_at":"2025-05-09T16:34:59Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2867181463/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]